<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen ends flat in tandem with JGB futures.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen ends flat in tandem with JGB futures.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key December three-month Euroyen futures contract ended flat on Monday, in sympathy with the March Japanese government bond futures contract.</p>
<p>The December Euroyen futures contract was stuck at 99.22 for much of the afternoon session, lifted by a rise in JGBs and weak Tokyo share prices.</p>
<p>But the December shed its gain toward the close in line with JGBs, a trader for a major brokerage house said.</p>
</text>
